  "content": "\n\n<h1>概述</h1>\n<p><strong>Lucky Block Challenge Race</strong> 是一张主打经典幸运方块挑战竞速的地图，设有两条不同的路线、可交互方块、检查点以及终点的PVP竞技场！</p>\n<h1>重要提示</h1>\n<p>本地图专为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/lucky-block-challenge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky Block Challenge Modpack</a> 制作，强烈建议您搭配该整合包使用。</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地图 Discord 频道</a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 横幅\"></a></p>",
